| FPO v2 θ4, expert fp32, seed 3000 | 19/50 = 38% (26–52) | 26/50 = 52% (39–65) | 45/100 = 45% (36–55) | 30/68 = 44% (33–56) | — | 18 / 11 | 0.26 |
| FPO v3 θ4, expert fp32, seed 3000 | 15/50 = 30% (19–44) | 27/50 = 54% (40–67) | 42/100 = 42% (33–52) | 26/68 = 38% (28–50) | — | 17 / 13 | 0.58 |
| FPO v4 (checkpoint theo quy tắc collapse), expert fp32, seed 3000 | 19/50 = 38% (26–52) | 28/50 = 56% (42–69) | 47/100 = 47% (38–57) | 29/68 = 43% (32–54) | — | 16 / 7 | 0.09 |

